This directory contains the DSP source (*.asm)  files for the SDSU2
controller when used with the version 2 VME interface card.
The makefile assembles and links these and places the OMF output
into the ".applTop/bin/asm56000"  directory.

The following DSP code is available:

timappl-39-full.asm	Timing board application code
			Full function version for CCD39 chip.
timappl-39.asm		Timing board application code
			Fast cut down version for CCD39 chip.
timappl-47-full.asm	Timing board application code
			Full function version for CCD47 chip.
timappl-47.asm		Timing board application code
			Fast cut down version for CCD47 chip.
timboot.asm		Timing board boot code (used to build a boot ROM image)
timhead.asm		Timing code header file
utilappl.asm		Utility board application code
utilboot.asm		Utility board boot code (used to build a boot ROM image)
utilhead.asm		Utility code header file
vmeappl.asm		VME board application code
vmeboot.asm		VME board boot code (used to build a boot ROM image)
vmehead.asm		VME code header file
